{"id":"e93778b32bbd2327","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-covering-space.md","title":"Covering Space","display":"df-covering-space — Covering Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-covering-space","aliases":["58-df-covering-space"],"display":"df-covering-space — Covering Space","depends_on":["[[58-df-local-homeomorphism]]","[[58-df-continuous-map]]","[[58-df-topological-space]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-covering-space"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-covering-space</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-covering-space — Covering Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"64ced038ad7f8f73\" href=\"?note=64ced038ad7f8f73\" title=\"58-df-local-homeomorphism\">58-df-local-homeomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3cd1834de4f2efb2\" href=\"?note=3cd1834de4f2efb2\" title=\"58-df-continuous-map\">58-df-continuous-map</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"58-df-topological-space\">58-df-topological-space</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Explicit relation signatures used below: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Continuous}_S\\subseteq V^{5}\">\\(\\mathrm{Continuous}_S\\subseteq V^{5}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CoveringSpace}_S\\subseteq V^{5}\">\\(\\mathrm{CoveringSpace}_S\\subseteq V^{5}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Homeomorphism}_S\\subseteq V^{5}\">\\(\\mathrm{Homeomorphism}_S\\subseteq V^{5}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widetilde X,X,\\tau_{\\widetilde X},\\tau_X\\in V\">\\(\\widetilde X,X,\\tau_{\\widetilde X},\\tau_X\\in V\\)</span> (topological spaces)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in X^{\\widetilde X}\">\\(p\\in X^{\\widetilde X}\\)</span> (projection)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CoveringSpace}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{CoveringSpace}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (covering-space predicate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Continuous}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Continuous}_S\\)</span> (continuous-map predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3cd1834de4f2efb2\" href=\"?note=3cd1834de4f2efb2\" title=\"58-df-continuous-map\">58-df-continuous-map</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Homeomorphism}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Homeomorphism}_S\\)</span> (homeomorphism predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3cd1834de4f2efb2\" href=\"?note=3cd1834de4f2efb2\" title=\"58-df-continuous-map\">58-df-continuous-map</a>)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}covering\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{CoveringSpace}_S(p,\\widetilde X,\\tau_{\\widetilde X},X,\\tau_X) \\;\\leftrightarrow\\; \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(\\widetilde X,\\tau_{\\widetilde X})\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\land p\\in X^{\\widetilde X}\\land p[\\widetilde X]=X\\land\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(p,\\widetilde X,\\tau_{\\widetilde X},X,\\tau_X)\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\exists U\\in\\tau_X\\;\\exists I\\in V\\;\\exists V_\\bullet\\in\\tau_{\\widetilde X}^{I}\\;\\Bigl(x\\in U\\land p^{-1}[U]=\\bigcup_{\\alpha\\in I}V_\\alpha\\land\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in I\\;(\\alpha\\neq\\beta\\to V_\\alpha\\cap V_\\beta=\\emptyset)\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in I\\;\\mathrm{Homeomorphism}_S\\!\\left(p\\upharpoonright V_\\alpha,V_\\alpha,\\{O\\cap V_\\alpha:O\\in\\tau_{\\widetilde X}\\},U,\\{O\\cap U:O\\in\\tau_X\\}\\right)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}covering\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{CoveringSpace}_S(p,\\widetilde X,\\tau_{\\widetilde X},X,\\tau_X) \\;\\leftrightarrow\\; \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(\\widetilde X,\\tau_{\\widetilde X})\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\land p\\in X^{\\widetilde X}\\land p[\\widetilde X]=X\\land\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(p,\\widetilde X,\\tau_{\\widetilde X},X,\\tau_X)\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\exists U\\in\\tau_X\\;\\exists I\\in V\\;\\exists V_\\bullet\\in\\tau_{\\widetilde X}^{I}\\;\\Bigl(x\\in U\\land p^{-1}[U]=\\bigcup_{\\alpha\\in I}V_\\alpha\\land\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in I\\;(\\alpha\\neq\\beta\\to V_\\alpha\\cap V_\\beta=\\emptyset)\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in I\\;\\mathrm{Homeomorphism}_S\\!\\left(p\\upharpoonright V_\\alpha,V_\\alpha,\\{O\\cap V_\\alpha:O\\in\\tau_{\\widetilde X}\\},U,\\{O\\cap U:O\\in\\tau_X\\}\\right)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Covering spaces locally look like disjoint copies of neighborhoods; the displayed homeomorphisms use the induced subspace topologies, not a set-theoretic restriction of the topology family.</li>\n<li>They relate to fundamental groups via deck transformations.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-local-homeomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"64ced038ad7f8f73","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-local-homeomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-continuous-map","status":"resolved","id":"3cd1834de4f2efb2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-continuous-map]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-topological-space","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-topological-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-continuous-map","status":"resolved","id":"3cd1834de4f2efb2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Continuous}_S$ (continuous-map predicate, see [[58-df-continuous-map]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-continuous-map","status":"resolved","id":"3cd1834de4f2efb2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Homeomorphism}_S$ (homeomorphism predicate, see [[58-df-continuous-map]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Continuous}_S\\subseteq V^{5}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CoveringSpace}_S\\subseteq V^{5}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Homeomorphism}_S\\subseteq V^{5}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^{2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\widetilde X,X,\\tau_{\\widetilde X},\\tau_X\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in X^{\\widetilde X}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CoveringSpace}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Continuous}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Homeomorphism}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}covering\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{CoveringSpace}_S(p,\\widetilde X,\\tau_{\\widetilde X},X,\\tau_X) \\;\\leftrightarrow\\; \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(\\widetilde X,\\tau_{\\widetilde X})\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\land p\\in X^{\\widetilde X}\\land p[\\widetilde X]=X\\land\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(p,\\widetilde X,\\tau_{\\widetilde X},X,\\tau_X)\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\exists U\\in\\tau_X\\;\\exists I\\in V\\;\\exists V_\\bullet\\in\\tau_{\\widetilde X}^{I}\\;\\Bigl(x\\in U\\land p^{-1}[U]=\\bigcup_{\\alpha\\in I}V_\\alpha\\land\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in I\\;(\\alpha\\neq\\beta\\to V_\\alpha\\cap V_\\beta=\\emptyset)\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in I\\;\\mathrm{Homeomorphism}_S\\!\\left(p\\upharpoonright V_\\alpha,V_\\alpha,\\{O\\cap V_\\alpha:O\\in\\tau_{\\widetilde X}\\},U,\\{O\\cap U:O\\in\\tau_X\\}\\right)\\Bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":2007,"backlinks":[{"id":"08fb6fd463430f87","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CoveringSpace}_S$ (covering-space predicate, see [[../batch19/58-df-covering-space.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-379","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-covering-space.md|58-df-covering-space]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["64ced038ad7f8f73","3cd1834de4f2efb2","815e63e5071e7b58"]}